WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Just now, I was taking a late night break

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Dad is away from home and no one brings food to him

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Turning around, Miss Ping'er delivered it.

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,000
thank you thank you

5
00:00:09,980 --> 00:00:10,980
Master, don't move

6
00:00:10,980 --> 00:00:15,100
Mr. Mi Li

7
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:17,100
Is there anything else I can do for you?

8
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:18,100
are you sure

9
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:22,820
There is one thing

10
00:00:22,820 --> 00:00:23,820
Let me take a look

11
00:00:23,820 --> 00:00:31,620
You look like you without a veil, sir

12
00:00:31,620 --> 00:00:32,620
Does it look good?

13
00:00:32,620 --> 00:00:35,620
Girl Ping'er's face

14
00:00:35,620 --> 00:00:42,780
It's so touching. What can I give you?

15
00:00:42,780 --> 00:00:48,340
Sir, please accept Fang Yang

16
00:00:48,340 --> 00:00:49,340
You really are

17
00:00:49,340 --> 00:00:50,340
The longer I live, the more I go back
